Cell["\<\
lattice -> {{a,0,0},{-a/2,Sqrt[3]a/2,0},{0,0,c}} gives the three primitive \
vectors of graphene by rows. The other four model inputs are supplied in the \
same call. The second bond shell then displays the three nearest-neighbour \
carbon bonds fixed by this lattice and Wyckoff position:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"a0f385ea-ab12-43ec-885c-f5924045fa24"],

