Cell["\<\
symminformation -> msgop[gray[191]] supplies the complete ordered \
magnetic-space-group records used for graphene. showSymmetryRepresentations[] \
displays the actual orbital matrices of the selected generators, including \
their unitary or antiunitary type:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"16209a29-46bc-4117-80bc-1952de5c92f7"],

