Cell["\<\
basisFunctions -> {{\"pz\"}} assigns one local pz orbital to the inequivalent \
carbon seed. Symmetry transports it to the second site, so orbitalTable[] \
contains two pz basis states and fixes their Hamiltonian row order:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"6000bb41-6d97-4c1f-bd67-545c66493281"],

