Cell["\<\
In cubic symmetry, RepresentationMode -> \"DirectProduct\" requires the \
complete local px, py, pz basis because rotations mix all three orbitals. The \
orbital table therefore contains all three orbitals on every \
symmetry-equivalent site:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"8f4c2179-74c3-4bb2-9248-7091eb80ef7e"],

